  </p>
  <p class="lede">
    I also created and sold
    <a href="https://www.cerberusemail.com/"><img src="/assets/img/logo-cerberus.svg" alt="" class="home-hero-logo" width="120" height="24">Cerberus</a>,
    an open source framework for email development, and built one of the first
    <a href="https://stackoverflow.design/email/"><img src="/assets/img/logo-emaildesignsystem.svg" alt="" class="home-hero-logo" width="120" height="24">email design systems</a>.
  </p>
